 a skeleton. Perhaps it holds something valuable.<br/>Looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton%20%28Item%29\">Skeleton (Item)</a>.<br/>One is part of the <a href=\"#/quest/lions-rock-quest\">Lion's Rock Quest</a>, another is part of <a href=\"#/quest/the-great-dragon-hunt-quest\">The Great Dragon Hunt Quest</a>, a third is part of the Glooth Factory Quest, and a fourth is part of the <a href=\"#/quest/the-first-dragon-quest\">First Dragon Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/First%20Dragon%20%28Book%29\">First Dragon (Book)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/lions-rock-quest\">Lion's Rock Quest</a></li><li>Living and Dead</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/oramond-quest\">Oramond Quest</a></li><li>Remains</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton%20%28Item%29\">Skeleton (Item)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tarun\">Tarun</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-first-dragon-quest\">The First Dragon Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-great-dragon-hunt-quest\">The Great Dragon Hunt Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["lions-rock-quest","oramond-quest","the-first-dragon-quest","the-great-dragon-hunt-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"lions-rock-quest","quest":"Lion's Rock Quest","step":"1-0","n":4,"title":"Usar o Dead Explorer","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33145,"y":32342,"z":8,"label":"Dead Explorer"}]},{"slug":"oramond-quest","quest":"Oramond Quest","step":"2-7","n":15,"title":"Ver o Dead Explorer (opcional)","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33563,"y":32021,"z":12,"label":"Dead Explorer"}]},{"slug":"the-first-dragon-quest","quest":"The First Dragon Quest","step":"0-2","n":3,"title":"Revistar o explorador m